## Remember
- **Use script ONLY**: NEVER create migrations manually - always use `./scripts/migrate.sh create`
- **Consistent timestamps**: Script ensures proper timestamping and naming conventions
- **Automatic validation**: Script validates naming before creating files
- **Idempotent operations**: All migrations must be safely repeatable
- **Rollback first**: Always design the Down migration before implementing Up
- **Test thoroughly**: Every migration must be tested in development first
- **Document clearly**: Include business context and dependencies
- **Safety first**: When in doubt, ask for review before production deployment